  "name": "telegram chatbot dok\u00fcmandan",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "de7cd45f-248f-40f6-b78f-8fba7328afce",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -224,
        48
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 784,
        "content": "## telegram chatbot dok\u00fcmandan\n\n### How it works\n\nBu i\u015f ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 Telegram\u2019dan gelen kullan\u0131c\u0131 mesaj\u0131n\u0131 al\u0131r, Google Docs\u2019taki \u015firket bilgisini okuyarak bir prompt haz\u0131rlar ve Anthropic destekli AI Agent ile yan\u0131t \u00fcretir. \u00dcretilen yan\u0131t tarih, soru, cevap ve chat ID alanlar\u0131yla d\u00fczenlenip Google Sheets\u2019e kaydedilir. Son olarak yan\u0131t temizlenerek Telegram \u00fczerinden kullan\u0131c\u0131ya geri g\u00f6nderilir.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Telegram Trigger ve Telegram g\u00f6nderim d\u00fc\u011f\u00fcmleri i\u00e7in bot token/Telegram kimlik bilgilerini yap\u0131land\u0131r\u0131n.\n- Google Docs d\u00fc\u011f\u00fcm\u00fcnde kullan\u0131lacak \u015firket bilgi dok\u00fcman\u0131n\u0131 ve Google kimlik bilgilerini se\u00e7in.\n- Anthropic Chat Model i\u00e7in Anthropic API kimlik bilgilerini ekleyin ve AI Agent ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 do\u011frulay\u0131n.\n- Google Sheets d\u00fc\u011f\u00fcm\u00fcnde kay\u0131t yap\u0131lacak tabloyu, sayfay\u0131 ve gerekli s\u00fctunlar\u0131 yap\u0131land\u0131r\u0131n.\n- Edit Fields d\u00fc\u011f\u00fcm\u00fcndeki tarih, soru, cevap ve chatid alanlar\u0131n\u0131n Sheets s\u00fctunlar\u0131yla e\u015fle\u015fti\u011fini kontrol edin.\n\n### Customization\n\n\u015eirket bilgi dok\u00fcman\u0131n\u0131, prompt haz\u0131rlama kodunu, AI modelini ve Google Sheets\u2019e kaydedilen alanlar\u0131 kendi chatbot senaryonuza g\u00f6re de\u011fi\u015ftirebilirsiniz."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "2073fc57-7b57-4014-b869-d9df0d5e062d",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        336,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 304,
        "content": "## Mesaj ve bilgi alma\n\nTelegram\u2019dan gelen mesaj\u0131 yakalar, \u015firket bilgisini Google Docs\u2019tan al\u0131r ve AI Agent\u2019a g\u00f6nderilecek promptu haz\u0131rlar."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "851db5cb-663c-49f9-8ea6-b6703f690f70",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1008,
        48
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 496,
        "height": 528,
        "content": "## AI yan\u0131t \u00fcretimi\n\nHaz\u0131rlanan promptu Anthropic sohbet modeli ve k\u0131sa s\u00fcreli haf\u0131za ile i\u015fleyerek kullan\u0131c\u0131 i\u00e7in AI yan\u0131t\u0131 \u00fcretir."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "9fe9802c-bbc3-4e6e-b14b-21a738b55acd",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1536,
        48
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 400,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Kay\u0131t alanlar\u0131n\u0131 haz\u0131rlama\n\nAI \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131s\u0131na tarih bilgisi ekler ve Google Sheets\u2019e yaz\u0131lacak tarih, soru, cevap ve chatid alanlar\u0131n\u0131 d\u00fczenler."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2f853-2549-4ca7-9f2a-dfb9c1d32bb0",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1968,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 688,
        "height": 304,
        "content": "## Kaydet ve cevapla\n\nKonu\u015fma kayd\u0131n\u0131 Google Sheets\u2019e ekler, yan\u0131t metnini temizler ve Telegram \u00fczerinden kullan\u0131c\u0131ya g\u00f6nderir."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
