    {
      "id": "308dd7bf-0c95-4637-9dd0-b4dd22c74bc9",
      "name": "Build AI Prompt from Docs",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        832,
        208
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const googleDocs = $input.all().map((item) => item.json);\nconst telegramData = $('When Telegram Message Received').all().map((item) => item.json);\n\nconst date = new Date();\nconst monthNames = [\"January\",\"February\",\"March\",\"April\",\"May\",\"June\",\"July\",\"August\",\"September\",\"October\",\"November\",\"December\"];\nconst formattedDate = `${monthNames[date.getMonth()]} ${date.getDate()}, ${date.getFullYear()}`;\n\nconst docText = googleDocs[0].content.split('\\n').join(' ');\n\nconst body = telegramData[0].message.text;\n\nconst finalPrompt = `Today's date is: ${formattedDate}\\n\\n${docText}\\n\\nUser's question:\\n${body}`;\n\nreturn { finalPrompt };"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "bd933130-41ef-44a5-a836-552e8d5738f2",
      "name": "Response Generation Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "maxTries": 5,
      "position": [
        1200,
        208
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "={{ $json.finalPrompt }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "Sen TrendShop'un m\u00fc\u015fteri destek asistan\u0131s\u0131n.\n\nG\u00f6revin, m\u00fc\u015fterilerin sorular\u0131n\u0131 elindeki bilgilere dayanarak net ve yard\u0131msever \u015fekilde yan\u0131tlamak.\n\nKurallar:\n- Samimi ve s\u0131cak ol \u2014 m\u00fc\u015fteriyle \"sen\" diliyle konu\u015f\n- Direkt cevaba ge\u00e7. \"Tabii ki!\", \"Harika soru!\" gibi gereksiz giri\u015fler yapma\n- \"Dok\u00fcman\u0131mda yazd\u0131\u011f\u0131na g\u00f6re\", \"bilgilerime g\u00f6re\" gibi ifadeler kullanma, hi\u00e7bir zaman dok\u00fcman veya kaynaktan bahsetme\n- Tarihten bahsetme, m\u00fc\u015fteri sormad\u0131k\u00e7a\n- Cevab\u0131n\u0131 bilmiyorsan \u015funu s\u00f6yle: \"Bu konuda sana daha iyi yard\u0131mc\u0131 olabilmem i\u00e7in user@example.com adresine yazman\u0131 \u00f6neririm.\"\n- M\u00fc\u015fteri hangi dilde yazarsa o dilde yan\u0131tla (T\u00fcrk\u00e7e \u2192 T\u00fcrk\u00e7e, \u0130ngilizce \u2192 \u0130ngilizce)\n- Cevaplar\u0131 k\u0131sa ve \u00f6z tut, gereksiz dolgu c\u00fcmleleri kullanma"
        },
        "promptType": "define",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "retryOnFail": false,
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
